>せわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をよくする<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">My mother looks after the plants well.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">飢える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">挨饿；饥饿；饿肚子；渴望；渴求；饥渴于（某种事物）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"108542\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>飢<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた<ruby>者<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>しょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>与<rp>(</rp><rt>あた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He furnished food to the hungry.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ウエートレス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">女服务员；女侍者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228306\">ウエートレスはテーブルの<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>白<rp>(</rp><rt>しろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いテーブルクロスをかけた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The waitress spread a white cloth over the table.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">浮かぶ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うかぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">浮动；悬浮；浮上；出现；浮现；显现；浮现在脑海中；产生灵感</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><sp