class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">听到；被告知；知道；接受（订单）；承担；应允；接受（预约等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216998\">ご<ruby>用<rp>(</rp><rt>よう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>承<rp>(</rp><rt>うけたまわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っておりますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Is anybody waiting on you?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">受取</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うけとり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">接收；收到</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146442\"><ruby>招待状<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうたいじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>お<ruby>受<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りをお<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らせください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Please respond at your earliest convenience.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">受け持つ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うけもつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">承担；负责；主管</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"85792\"><ruby>費用<rp>(</rp><rt>ひよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>受<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ<ruby>者<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>決定権<rp>(</rp><rt>けっていけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He who pays the piper calls the tune.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">薄暗い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うすぐら