b/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">否认；反驳；抵消（尤指声音）；盖过；淹没</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">うっかり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不小心；疏忽地；无意中</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"161315\">うっかりそれを<ruby>忘<rp>(</rp><rt>わす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れるところだったわ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I almost forgot all about that.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">討つ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">攻击；摧毁；击败；征服；复仇</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">映す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うつす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">投映；反射；投射（影子）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"190046\"><ruby>一本<rp>(</rp><rt>いっぽん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>水面<rp>(</rp><rt>すいめん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>影<rp>(</rp><rt>かげ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>映<rp>(</rp><rt>うつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">A tall tree projects its